# The server image's build context is the repository root (apps/server/Dockerfile). A self-hoster keeps the filled .env
# in apps/server, next to compose.yaml: it never reaches the build, nor do the host's node_modules or build output.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
.git
**/.output
**/.wxt
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.pem
